### Is there an existing issue for this?

- [x] I have searched the existing issues

### Current Behavior

`ShortestResponseLoadBalancer` computes `succeededAverageElapsed * inflight`, but neither its selection path nor Divide's shortestResponse completion path updates `inflight`. A fresh upstream starts at 1, so this usually compares historical successful average latency only. A historically fast upstream continues to receive requests even as its pending queue grows.

### Expected Behavior

Maintain outstanding request accounting for this strategy, paired across request start and all terminal signals, so increasing concurrency affects the estimate.

### Steps To Reproduce

Create two healthy upstreams A and B with equal positive weights. Set both inflight values to 1, and initialize successful response metrics:

```java
a.getSucceeded().set(1);
a.getSucceededElapsed().set(10);
b.getSucceeded().set(1);
b.getSucceededElapsed().set(100);
var balancer = new ShortestResponseLoadBalancer();
int aHits = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 100; i++) {
    if (balancer.select(List.of(a, b), new LoadBalanceData()) == a) {
        aHits++;
    }
}
System.out.println(aHits);                 // observed: 100
System.out.println(a.getInflight().get()); // observed: 1
```

Do not complete requests between selections. The result was reproduced against the commit below. In Divide, the shortestResponse callback only records successful elapsed time and count; it does not fix the missing inflight accounting.

### Anything else?

- Selection: https://github.com/apache/shenyu/blob/862f5e37e894bd8cef85ef540a8629f313e9ecdf/shenyu-loadbalancer/src/main/java/org/apache/shenyu/loadbalancer/spi/ShortestResponseLoadBalancer.java#L43-L49
- Completion metrics: https://github.com/apache/shenyu/blob/862f5e37e894bd8cef85ef540a8629f313e9ecdf/shenyu-plugin/shenyu-plugin-proxy/shenyu-plugin-divide/src/main/java/org/apache/shenyu/plugin/divide/DividePlugin.java#L201-L208
- Related but different issue: #6544 addressed the start-time race, not missing inflight accounting.

### Environment

- ShenYu: master, 2.7.2-SNAPSHOT
- Commit: `862f5e37e894bd8cef85ef540a8629f313e9ecdf`
- Java 17

