### How are you using Babel?

`@babel/core` Node API, parsing and printing TypeScript without stripping types. No plugins, presets, core-js or project configuration.

### Input code

`input.ts`:

```ts
import type X = require('./only-types');
console.log('loaded');
```

`only-types.d.ts`, with no corresponding JavaScript module:

```ts
